  "review_after": "2027-08-31",
  "notes": "Named office holders, phone numbers, and room numbers are annual-volatility facts verified 2026-08-31. The Provost's Office roster is internally inconsistent: at least one staff card's profile link resolves to a different person. Only the Academic Affairs Committee publishes notices, agendas, and minutes publicly; the August 2023 Faculty Handbook's committee structure is a 2023 description, not a current roster. Several Provost menu items and both ALC faculty deep links resolve to the intranet. Authenticated entry points are deliberately absent from sources[]: docs/integration-contracts.md states a login response cannot count as public verification. Verified 2026-08-31 by anonymous request, every intranet.ncf.edu path tested returned the myNCF login portal and ses.ncf.edu redirected to single sign-on; that boundary is described in the resource prose instead of cited as evidence."
}
